From 2f1c952abc8f7c375cc54f7c9901e341867acda3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nectarine <nectarine@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 14:00:33 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/29] ntdll, server: Give macOS multi-object waits private
 wake words.

All multi-address waiters shared one wake generation, so every wake of a watched
object woke every alertable or multi-object waiter in the prefix (Wine services
included). Each such wait now takes a wake word from a slot bitmap in reserved
shm and registers it in the bucket lists of its addresses; wakers wake only the
registered words. A full bucket list falls back to the shared generation.
The shared bookkeeping moves to include/wine/fsync_mac.h.
---
 dlls/ntdll/unix/fsync.c  |  83 +++++++++++----------
 include/wine/fsync_mac.h | 152 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 server/fsync.c           |  35 ++-------
 3 files changed, 199 insertions(+), 71 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 include/wine/fsync_mac.h

